  "title": {
    "todo": true,
    "source": "Garmin戴上GPS，為何還不能立刻跑？｜品牌故事",
    "text": ""
  },
  "description": {
    "todo": true,
    "source": "把GPS戴上手腕，還不等於一趟跑步記得好。從2003年11月出貨的Forerunner201，沿著充電與初次鎖星、配速平滑和目標夥伴、歷史保存與序列埠上傳，接到2006年205/305的腕旁天線、胸帶識別碼和記錄容量，再看2009長期使用者如何處理資料。\n\n201手冊是2006年2月RevF，205/305手冊是RevD©2006–2008，不能把後期手冊全當首發韌體。15–30分鐘只指201初次定位，3.5小時指305每秒記錄的詳細資料容量。DC Rainmaker原帖2007，但本片採明示2009-06-25大幅更新的自述，非受控精度實驗；未採動態比較表、讀者留言或游泳建議。手機競爭沒有被寫成2003跑錶發明動機。畫面為匿名概念插畫。\n\n來源（查閱2026-10-26）\nForerunner 201 Owner’s Manual\nhttps://static.garmin.com/pumac/Forerunner201_OwnersManual.pdf\nForerunner 205/305 preliminary specification sheet\nhttps://www8.garmin.com/specs/forerunner205305_0106.pdf\nTwenty years of running with Garmin\nhttps://www.garmin.com/en-US/blog/fitness/twenty-years-of-running-with-garmin/\nGarmin FY2003 Form 10-K, original SEC filing\nhttps://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1121788/000112178804000005/form10k_122703.txt\nForerunner 201 preliminary specification sheet\nhttps://www8.garmin.com/specs/Forerunner_201_Sneak.pdf\nGarmin FY2008 Form 10-K\nhttps://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1121788/000114420409010751/v141191_10k.htm\nForerunner 205/305 Owner’s Manual\nhttps://static.garmin.com/pumac/984_OwnersManual.pdf\nDC Rainmaker: Review of GarminForerunner305; major2009update\nhttps://www.dcrainmaker.com/2007/11/review-of-garmin-forerunner-305.html",
    "text": ""
  },
